Runtime Components
Component	Responsibility
KernelRuntime	Runtime facade
RuntimeLoop	Main execution loop
RuntimeExecutor	Execute scheduled tasks
RuntimeWorker	Worker abstraction
Scheduler	Task scheduling
Task Queue	Pending execution queue
AgentExecutor	Invoke cognitive execution
Cognitive Pipeline	Execute reasoning pipeline
